Subject: [PATCH] IDOR: GET /notes/<id> returns any user's note without an owner check

Fix idor:notesapp/notes.py:get_note.

Root cause: get_note in notesapp/notes.py performs authentication only and omits the require_owner authorization check that delete_note applies before acting on the note.

Fix strategy: Call require_owner(user, note) in get_note before returning the note, matching delete_note. Optionally return 404 for notes the caller does not own, so existence is not leaked.

